  m_text: "A tame meadow that is home to various edible berries \nand plants and
    some mildly tempremental sheep... \n\nFood is sparce and won't add much to the
    pot, but you can rest easy there are no bears in these woods.\n\nI think...\n\nAnyway,
    goodluck!!"
